WEBVTT

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:37.320
Uncle Yuri!

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:42.030
Since you invited Arte, does that mean
she knows about your hobby?

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.900
Yes, even though I didn't mean for her to.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:49.690
Today's dinner is also hush money, got it?

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.320
Right...

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:26.280
"Katarina's Dinner"

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:26.280
This is the kitchen at Uncle Yuri's house.

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:29.360
Everyone, I look forward
to working with you today!

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:31.030
--Welcome, Lady Katarina!
--We've been waiting for you!

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:32.650
Lady Katarina!

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:34.980
Now, let's start cooking!

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.280
Everyone, please help me!

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:42.360
I'll use the broth later...
Leave the skins on...

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:47.940
Katarina... I didn't know
she could look so happy.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.610
Come, now, it's time to eat!

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:53.860
You're serving today, too, Yuri?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:58.400
At Katarina's dinners, those who
don't help aren't allowed to eat.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.320
I see...

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:08.110
It's really fun to eat like this
with everyone, too!

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:11.730
But why did you decide to start cooking?

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.900
Katarina, I'm coming in.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:25.400
I made the bread soup you like.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.480
Bread soup?

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:30.030
I'm the one who made it,
though. Gimo just helped.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:34.280
Be quiet, I was basically the one who made it.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:44.900
It's so yummy! I'm glad I went to sleep!

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:49.980
The bread soup I had when I was little
was so delicious, I learned how to make it.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:53.400
By bread soup, do you mean
the dish made with stale bread?

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.530
It's clear even looking just at food

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:59.230
how nobles want there to be a difference
between them and those poorer than them.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.280
Is there really a point in that?

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.480
Why do they want there to be a difference?

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:05.570
Huh?

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:07.650
Standing up straight...

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:10.280
...stepping back with one foot...

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:13.190
...and lifting the hem of a dress gently.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.530
Even with this unassuming greeting,

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:19.360
they want to flaunt how they're
different from others, right?

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:23.730
I don't want to do something
so embarrassing in public.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:32.070
My niece is tough, right?

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:36.030
You've gotten this far,
even being invited to her dinner.

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:39.400
You're the first one she's liked this much.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.650
I've got high expectations for you.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:46.150
I-Is that right...?

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.780
Um...

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:52.690
Was Katarina already like that when she
returned from where she was raised?

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:55.110
Huh? What do you mean by "like that"?

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:59.280
Like stubborn... or with her heart closed off...

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:02.730
I thought maybe something had happened
to her before she returned...

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:07.230
If you promise to carry out
your work until it is completed,

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:10.070
then I'll tell you everything I know.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:13.730
Until... it's finished...?

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.440
What's the matter? This isn't like you.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.980
You're not confident?

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:22.110
Oh, no, that's not it.

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:25.900
Yuri, I'd like to confirm something.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.030
What is it?

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:31.900
Who was I hired for? And to do what?

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:35.030
You're here for the sake
of Katarina's happiness.

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.940
I see. I understand.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:47.530
I promise, I'll give my all to make sure
Katarina can become happy.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:54.860
As you know, it's normal for wet nurses
to raise the children of wealthy families.

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:59.190
When Katarina was born, Buona,
the wife of the cook, had plenty of milk,

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:03.360
so she was chosen to be her wet nurse.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:09.780
Katarina was raised far from Venice
in a countryside villa with open fields.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:14.320
My older brother, Malta, didn't care about
Katarina because she was a girl,

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:18.900
so he only sent the bare minimum
of money and servants to the villa.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:24.280
Luckily, Buona was hardworking and
made herself useful around the villa.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:29.610
Buona's son, Gimo, was two years older
than Katarina, and they were raised together.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:34.780
Gimo also loved Katarina like his own sister.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:39.150
But when Katarina was six,
Buona died from a sudden illness,

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:42.730
and Katarina was abruptly called back.

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.360
Katarina...

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.570
It's me.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:50.980
Uncle Yuri...

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:54.690
Is there anything you'd like me to do?

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:59.150
I want to eat... bread soup...

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:10.110
Katarina was embarrassed to act like a noble.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:15.650
I wonder if that's because she thinks
of Buona and Gimo as her real family.

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:17.030
I wonder...

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:24.190
Even if Katarina thinks that,
her parents are my brother and sister-in-law.

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:28.650
This is the place where she should be,
and this is where her happiness lies.

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:33.530
Accepting that and moving on
is how she will find her happiness.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.280
That's what I believe.

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:47.320
Um... Yuri, about yesterday...
I shouldn't tell Katarina about it, right?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:55.070
Hm... Katarina, I told her about
how you were raised, okay?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.980
Now, do your best.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.980
Y-Y-Yuri... What did you just do?

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:05.150
How am I supposed to do my best like this?

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:08.980
U-Um... I'm sorry.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:10.650
Why are you apologizing?

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.530
Well, I thought you were angry...

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:16.110
Not really. I don't care about stuff like that.

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:17.190
Huh?

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:21.360
I already know you like prying
into other people's affairs.

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:28.150
Besides, if I look like I'm in
a bad mood, it's not your fault.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:32.690
It's because I have to go back <i>there</i> now.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:37.190
"There"? But it's her own home...

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:39.400
Welcome back, my lady.

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:40.650
That's how it is.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:44.400
Oh, did you go to Yuri's place?

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.360
Continue.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:48.280
Arte, thank you for accompanying Katarina.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:48.280
Yes, my lord. About your
appointments for tomorrow...

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.150
It was a big help.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:52.150
Oh, I didn't really do anything...

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:56.570
I wonder...

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.780
What is this feeling...?

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:03.150
I see... No one in this house...

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:07.320
...is looking at Katarina.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:14.730
To me, the Katarina here
doesn't look happy at all.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:19.480
I'm sure, if Buona was alive,
she would still be...

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.570
Gimo!

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:30.110
Katarina! Let's go see Gimo!

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.610
Huh? You're not surprised?

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:36.230
Well, I already guessed at what you'd do,

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.570
and besides, it won't do
any good going to see Gimo.

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:41.230
Huh? Why not?

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:44.150
You mustn't act like this, Lady Katarina.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:50.150
I am your wet nurse. You have a
proper mother named Lady Sofia.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:53.980
I don't know any Sofia...

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.690
Lady Katarina?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.400
I've never seen or met her...

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:01.980
You're the only mother I have, Buona!

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:09.360
No, Lady Katarina.
Gimo and I are <i>not</i> your family.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.440
I hate you, Buona!

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:24.320
In the end, that was the last time I saw Buona.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:30.230
Buona got sick and died in the blink of an eye,
and I never saw Gimo again, either.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.900
I couldn't even say goodbye.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:37.900
After that, I came to this house,
and I was so, so sad...

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.320
So I wrote Gimo a letter.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:44.820
I won't see you again.

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:47.650
Don't write any more letters, either.

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:54.650
To the two of them... I wasn't family at all...

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:58.650
Arte, I can see "This is awkward"
written all over your face.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:01.690
"This is awkward."
O-O-Of course not...!

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:05.070
You're too easy to understand.

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:09.480
Paint my portrait, too.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:12.860
With you like that, it's annoying for me, too.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:18.030
But it's hard to just switch
back to normal, right?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:23.650
Yeah! I will! I'll paint you!
I'll paint you enthusiastically!

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:29.480
All right! I'll paint you like I'm using
all my wages on my materials!

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.940
Let's see... What kind of
painting should I make it?

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.570
I had her let me make a bunch of sketches...

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:40.190
Oh, that's good!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:42.480
Yuri, when did you get here?!

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:45.230
I heard you're looking for Gimo.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:47.280
H-How did you know...?

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:52.110
You can't hide anything that
goes on in this house from me.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.070
Well, did you find him?

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:56.860
No, I haven't had any leads...

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.860
Murano Island. That's where Gimo is.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.070
Huh?! Um, why--?

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.900
What I said the other day was
just my own personal opinion.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:12.780
If you think what you're doing will make
my niece happy, then that's good enough.

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:14.690
I'm off, then.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.730
Huh? That's it?

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:18.980
Was there anything else?

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.980
Well, no, but...

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:25.320
Why do you have so much faith in me?

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:31.150
Hm... I think it's a little different.
It's not that I have faith in you.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.530
Huh?

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:37.570
It's that I have faith in my
own decision of choosing you.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:49.150
Well, even if he says that...
What am I supposed to do now?

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:53.070
I'm totally stuck.

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:56.730
Yes? Come in!

00:12:56.730 --> 00:13:01.150
Excuse me, Miss Arte? Lady Sofia is waiting.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.860
Oh, no!

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:07.480
I totally forgot that I was supposed
to paint her portrait today!

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:14.230
Shoot. I've totally made her wait.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.360
Good grief, can nothing be done about that girl?

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:21.110
She turned out better looking than I expected,
so I thought maybe she could be useful,

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:23.730
but I didn't think she'd be <i>this</i> bad.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:28.980
At this rate, no one will take her
without an enormous dowry.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:34.320
That's why girls are a bother.
Maybe we should just make her join a convent.

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:36.360
Dear...

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:42.230
I've heard parents talking about
their child like this before.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:46.860
Mother always opposed the way Father
did things and argued with him.

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:52.150
But the two of them always agreed on one thing.

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:54.980
"It's for her sake."

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.650
Goodness, what am I to do?

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:01.650
Hm?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.780
You're receiving a lot of money from my brother.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:08.690
I don't care what you do. I'm counting
on you to train my daughter.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:13.530
I can't listen to you.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:16.440
Huh? What did you just say?

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:21.820
I was hired to come here for Katarina's sake.

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.900
That's why I can't listen

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:28.650
to the words of someone like you,
who isn't thinking of her happiness one bit.

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:31.230
Wh-What did you say?!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:43.190
Sofia, why won't you say anything even when
Katarina is being talked about like that?

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:46.940
Do you agree with Malta?

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.530
My parents often argued about me.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:51.230
There were confrontations

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:55.360
and times when what they wanted was
different from what I wanted for myself.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:59.650
But they always thought about my happiness.

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:04.030
You're not trying to face Katarina earnestly,

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:07.280
so there's no way she would
open her heart to you.

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:10.110
Excuse me.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:14.860
That's right.

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:19.230
The adults in this house shouldn't be
the ones deciding Katarina's happiness.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.480
I mean, there isn't anyone in this house

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:25.980
who's really thinking about her
and what she wants!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.280
Katarina!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.030
Let's go see Gimo!

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:35.570
Huh? Wh-What are you saying?
We talked about this before already, didn't we?

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:36.940
That was the end of it.

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:40.900
Katarina, hating to act like a noble...

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:43.900
...not being yourself
in front of your parents...

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:50.610
If you keep this up, you won't get anywhere.
You won't be able to become anything.

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:55.150
What you want to do, what you're going
to do--decide that for yourself.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:58.150
I decided what I would do by myself.

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.570
If you decide for yourself,
then no matter how hard things get,

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:04.440
you'll be able to accept that
all you can do is move forward.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.320
So in order to decide that,

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:11.360
you should go see Gimo and make sure
of his feelings and clear everything up!

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:21.820
All right. I'll go see Gimo.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:32.530
So that's Murano Island.

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:40.650
It'll be fine. Don't be so worried.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:42.400
I'm here with you, too!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:44.190
R-Right...

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:48.730
All right, let's go find
Gimo's house. The address is...

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:52.480
Huh? Huh? Huh? That's weird...

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:54.860
I thought I put it in here...

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.980
Here it is!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:05.360
Sorry to make you wait, Katarina--

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:08.110
Huh? Huh?

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:10.150
Katarina!

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:11.860
Where are you?

00:17:19.110 --> 00:17:22.280
I'm outside of town...

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:23.780
There you are!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.070
Katarina!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.400
Arte!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.570
Don't come see me again!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.730
Wh-Why not?

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:40.190
I want to see you. I think of you as family.

00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:44.860
Buona worried about you
until just before she died.

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:48.570
I was told that I couldn't see you.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.780
Wh-Why not?

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:56.900
Because your real family were
the Faliers, and you're a noble.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:18:00.230
Buona said, "You can't choose your birth.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:02.690
No matter how hard it was
or how much you hated it,

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:07.150
all you could do was accept it
and move forward."

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:11.570
There are a lot of things I face every day
that are hard and that I hate,

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.650
but I accept it and do my best every day.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:19.230
What about you? Are you facing forward
and doing your best?

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:26.030
Katarina, you're as dear as real
family to me and to Buona.

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:30.110
That's why I want you to face
forward properly and move on.

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:34.150
Bye.

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:42.650
If I face forward properly and move on...
and become independent, will you see me again?

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.570
I'm looking forward to it.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:55.570
K-Katarina...

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:58.730
It's fine...

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:03.940
I'm fine, so let's go back... back home...

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:12.360
In the end, after that,
I couldn't say anything to Katarina.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:19.730
When we got back, Katarina said she wasn't
feeling well and stayed in bed for three days.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:25.070
Then, still unable to do anything,
I was dismissed.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:31.440
Katarina, what are you doing here?

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.860
Father, Mother.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:43.280
I'm sorry that I was ill for so long and
stayed in my room and caused you to worry.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:50.570
Since when were you able
to behave properly like that?

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:54.530
Father, I have a favor to ask of you.

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:57.530
Please don't make Arte leave.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:02.940
I was the one who said I wanted
to go to Murano Island.

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:06.730
Arte only went along with my selfish desire.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.400
I am the one at fault.

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:10.400
Katarina...

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.480
What are you saying?

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:16.480
No, no, this isn't something
for children to meddle in!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:20.610
D-Dear...

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:25.480
Let us ignore what happened the other day
and wait and see how things go.

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:26.780
What?

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:31.150
Because Katarina... our daughter...
wishes for it to be so.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:34.610
What are you saying, too?

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:39.070
I think that is what is best for Katarina.

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.610
Wh--?

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:48.980
Do what you want!

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:55.440
Katarina, are you okay now?

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.860
Yes. Sorry to make you worry.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:03.480
I decided. I decided that I would
do my best, so it's fine now.

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:10.070
Lady Sofia! Um, thank you for helping me!

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.900
It's for Katarina's sake.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:18.150
Lady Sofia, your hands...

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:20.280
Oh, my. How embarrassing.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:24.150
It was my first time giving
my opinion to my husband.

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:29.190
I've been thinking about what you said
the other day this whole time.

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:30.900
Katarina.

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:37.070
I always thought I was looking at you,
but I never faced you properly.

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:40.650
I'm sorry. I'm a failure as a mother.

00:21:46.980 --> 00:21:50.150
Lady Sofia, what's the matter?

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:52.530
I'm embarrassed to say this,

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:57.570
but I do not know what a mother
would do at a time like this...

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:01.780
I want...

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:06.230
I want you to hug me tight.

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:11.530
Yes, of course. I can do that.

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:14.610
Come here, Katarina!

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:19.230
My daughter!

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:59.410
"Preview"

00:23:56.570 --> 00:23:59.900
I wonder if she's doing her
job properly in Venice...

00:23:59.900 --> 00:24:01.690
But if it's her, no matter what happens--

00:24:01.690 --> 00:24:05.730
Leo, I'm not smiling like that right now.

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:11.010
"The Faliers' Portrait Painter"

00:24:05.730 --> 00:24:08.230
Next time, "The Faliers' Portrait Painter."

00:24:08.230 --> 00:24:10.980
What should I do?
